// Single source of truth (choosing another product or adding to the cart starts the card over; the cart stays): { screen: 'cardapio', 'carrinho' (#carrinho) or 'checkout' (#checkout) or 'endereco' (#endereco; in all three, the category stays the last one seen), category: 'hamburgueres' or a key of categories, product: Receita id, editing, removed: applied ids, draft: ids in the open editor, combo, drink: Bebida do combo ('' until chosen; only with the combo), drinkError: the combo was added without a drink, qty: Quantidade (1-99), picks: per photo category, its selected product and Quantidade, cart: Items, each with its unit price (with the combo); the Carrinho edits their Quantidade, combo and drink by index (itemQty, itemCombo, itemDrink) without merging them, and removes them (itemRemove); lastRemoved: the Item just removed and its index, for Desfazer (itemUndo), until the next change in the cart or leaving the Carrinho, null otherwise; Continuar marks the first combo without a drink with drinkError }.
